 hockey coach</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:93bbbadb50f0f6cb80470a066f4584f867f9939481d695bab3543f64c0eaf5e3</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T14:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/andre-rankel-named-germany-s-new-men-s-ice-hockey-coach/a-78532470--9672475007d3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/andre-rankel-named-germany-s-new-men-s-ice-hockey-coach/a-78532470?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's men's ice hockey team has appointed a new head coach following a string of dissappointing tournaments. He's two decades younger than the man he's replacing but he has no previous experience as a head coach.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>New study shows German football remains male-dominated</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c5638d23fcd02ab4461f7b151a4758f2bdc66e36563d597d41963035c6bf267b</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T13:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-study-shows-german-football-remains-male-dominated/a-78532569--b9ee319bf21e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-study-shows-german-football-remains-male-dominated/a-78532569?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The top leagues of German football remain a largely male environment. A new study reveals that only seven clubs have women in upper management levels.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Venus' US Open invitation raises questions about wild cards</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:deb2508323879902f3e6beed31182792205eb1fbe51611eb275d56014b8bfbfd</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T12:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/venus-us-open-invitation-raises-questions-about-wild-cards/a-78524056--49b415adc5c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="http