s-to-delay-care/a-78455430?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A single chemotherapy session in Iran can cost six times the monthly minimum wage. As drug prices soar and medicine is in short supply, doctors say more patients are delaying or abandoning treatment.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Sydney Marathon medal wrongly shows German landmark</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cc655bd2feb40ec8e961b13eb628bdb39b70a3985e9c5c5f113a749666258128</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-23T06:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sydney-marathon-medal-wrongly-shows-german-landmark/a-78473705--c4d12c38e946.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sydney-marathon-medal-wrongly-shows-german-landmark/a-78473705?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A medal minted for finishers in the Sydney Marathon features a skyline of the city — with one landmark from rather far away. Organizers say the muddle only makes the medal "a little more unique."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Masha and the Bear': Ukraine sanctions Russian cartoon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:69f051fe9fc262cabc298dd654b161e5f2afc5f8520657f9ade42ac642f54d1d</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T18:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/masha-and-the-bear-ukraine-sanctions-russian-cartoon/a-78464406--5a8b6056ca62.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/masha-and-the-bear-ukraine-sanctions-russian-cartoon/a-78464406?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine has imposed sanctions on the hit Russian children's cartoon "Masha and the Bear," a step towards banning it. The culture minister called the show propaganda. Russia said the move showed Kyiv's "ugly nature."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bauhaus Manifesto: Broad alliance promoting artistic freedom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8ad74993829aa8c2f8dac2ea944eeb4fc2958ffb83eb6861bee66a88e028f6a3</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T10:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bauhaus-manifesto-broad-alliance-promoting-artistic-freedom/a-78456460--2d3d86ae9554.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bauhaus-manifesto-broad-alliance-promoting-artistic-freedom/a-78456460?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Weeks before Saxony-Anhalt's state election, representatives from German cultural, crafts, architecture, design and church sectors unite to promote freedom, openness and creativity.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Ronaldinho to make football comeback aged 46</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fc44ca4c8c8bd39b851c825327f0e33186df600916e894663e0e324f0f29abe6</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T08:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ronaldinho-to-make-football-comeback-aged-46/a-78453950--1b84029c6c14.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ronaldinho-to-make-football-comeback-aged-46/a-78453950?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More than a decade after his last professional appearance, Brazilian superstar Ronaldinho is set for a comeback. The former world player of the year is to play in Italy’s third tier.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Why Germany's gas storage levels are so low</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:410c329f739cda1dc0ade31dda3f25c3d933915ca3d9dd932402a6c41a77482b</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-20T14:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-gas-storage-levels-are-so-low/a-78440677--5b5bdc8c00df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-germany-s-gas-storage-levels-are-so-low/a-78440677?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's gas storage facilities are only 50% full as traders bet that wholesale prices will fall if the Iran war ends. With around three months until winter, DW asks whether the country can refill its reserves in time.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>How Europe can better protect against extreme wildfires</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:144b7e0239fd1d7748ef7e2ff91f30350e33b0a91b89c94213d93aebdb74cf6d</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-20T09:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-europe-can-better-protect-against-extreme-wildfires/a-78435243--a1a3032b9e1f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-europe-can-better-protect-against-extreme-wildfires/a-78435243?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In another summer of European wildfires that have even seen wetlands burning, scientists say the situation is set to worsen in the future. What's needed is fire prevention and climate protection.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Bernadette Amani 'living her dream' at Bayern Munich</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2f071ce9a531527e192be5f2ea1b7ba38ef782be1e5da825aa2a1892d457097f</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-20T08:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bernadette-amani-living-her-dream-at-bayern-munich/a-78141213--b6c7f9815814.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bernadette-amani-living-her-dream-at-bayern-munich/a-78141213?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bernadette Amani is heading into her first full season with Bayern Munich, having joined the club in January. Making a living at football is something she never imagined possible while growing up in rural Ivory Coast.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Evergrande founder Hui Ka Yan sentenced to life in prison</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03d06af47f122ca27ead9918f2ba84aab9dcd597f6db1b549f725639aad0a8ee</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-20T07:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/evergrande-founder-hui-ka-yan-sentenced-to-life-in-prison/a-78439153--ba088f0f4c18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/evergrande-founder-hui-ka-yan-sentenced-to-life-in-prison/a-78439153?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Chinese court ordered the former billionaire's assets to be confiscated and fined Evergrande-related companies billions of dollars.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala collapses on pitch again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:953ca6388bec4490c435ce957dd7a2c852aab944af87bbacc0af6dcd2dae7396</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T10:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021--80b4bb68cef0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-s-jamal-musiala-collapses-on-pitch-again/a-78426021?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of Germany's top footballers has collapsed on the pitch for a second time in four days ahead of the new season. Bayern Munich's Jamal Musiala has said he has a "neurological dysfunction" that causes blackouts.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Who really owns the Caspian Sea?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0018a1f5a35cb31af6619a4de28736fd7e39035129018d43c4427e34cdc7da01</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T09:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/who-really-owns-the-caspian-sea/a-78396946--815c4887a22c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/who-really-owns-the-caspian-sea/a-78396946?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Five countries border the Caspian Sea, but none owns a fixed share. A 2018 convention established rules for navigation, security and fishing while leaving some seabed borders unresolved.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Messi retirement hint highlights football era nearing an end</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:36a71484874259e7dddb2191881de86ed02718d4e511757ab6a5aef5007f6ce7</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T08:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/messi-retirement-hint-highlights-football-era-nearing-an-end/a-78415527--f2918eb8eee5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/messi-retirement-hint-highlights-football-era-nearing-an-end/a-78415527?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Soon after propelling Argentina to a second consecutive World Cup final, Lionel Messi has cast some doubt on his future. While retirement doesn't seem imminent, it still beckons for him and Cristiano Ronaldo.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>In drought-stricken France, tankers supply drinking water</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15c90cb406b621946b812ace10f1c4194a9bc9d9921665cd362c7e2e5f1e4fe9</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-19T04:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/in-drought-stricken-france-tankers-supply-drinking-water/a-78420016--bd4077809bc7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/in-drought-stricken-france-tankers-supply-drinking-water/a-78420016?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">France is seeing water shortages in regions that usually have plenty of supply. This summer's extreme heat is exposing how unprepared much of the country, and Europe, is for increasing water scarcity.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Will Germany's drought push up food prices?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:87351e693eff170c4e32df490e3abb4d7a3dd46ce2e81064e16e3fe9e3ce5599</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T14:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-germany-s-drought-push-up-food-prices/a-78408203--1f8c5e8778fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-germany-s-drought-push-up-food-prices/a-78408203?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's main farmers' association has warned of a below-average harvest after drought and crops damaged by extreme heat. DW looks into what lower yields could mean for food prices and grocery bills.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Dressed for power: Giorgia Meloni and the language of fashion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:504f810162d86b221974c01def865ef8729095cf79df34825c9a695de11c7a74</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T14:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dressed-for-power-giorgia-meloni-and-the-language-of-fashion/a-78413559--c708abdeeebc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dressed-for-power-giorgia-meloni-and-the-language-of-fashion/a-78413559?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From Giorgia Meloni's shift from dark suits to pastels to Angela Merkel's signature jackets, politicians have long used clothing to shape how voters see them. In this day and age, power dressing has evolved.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>How to grow food for more people in a hotter world</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:50f32171e261efab0fb5d0c3d7d95fe7d4996f5e63cce7ed51ed8db1f3f76b98</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T13:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-to-grow-food-for-more-people-in-a-hotter-world/a-78413324--6e9042895db0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-to-grow-food-for-more-people-in-a-hotter-world/a-78413324?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Inside futuristic labs, plants are scanned, stressed and analyzed. The aim is to use the results to produce plant strains that can better serve a growing population in a warming world.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Do not inhale! How wildfire smoke 'affects the whole body'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6e8dc852957d496ce7d2533246b4e1e2bbdfcd13be0c9be3419b3b5a1e455cb3</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-18T08:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/do-not-inhale-how-wildfire-smoke-affects-the-whole-body/a-76039654--04a98638c5fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/do-not-inhale-how-wildfire-smoke-affects-the-whole-body/a-76039654?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Wildfires destroy lives and livelihoods. But survivors and firefighters also suffer long-term harm to their health. A growing body of research suggests particulate matter (PM2.5) in wildfire smoke is a major culprit.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Norway wealth fund sounds alarm on AI stock market bubble</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6026d8199fc6eeacb4a32921219ec2b1a54082eb707b398f6d733b750fc1d679</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-17T14:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-wealth-fund-sounds-alarm-on-ai-stock-market-bubble/a-78351371--685600a6d47d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-wealth-fund-sounds-alarm-on-ai-stock-market-bubble/a-78351371?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The head of Norway's sovereign wealth fund has warned that soaring AI-driven stock valuations could trigger a sharp correction. How exposed is the world's largest sovereign wealth fund to a market downturn?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Can the cool north handle a surge in climate tourism?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:48d7f60f9b546d3573973740e52ea0275597cb1a37278e68b820d79a1c8f3541</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-17T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-the-cool-north-handle-a-surge-in-climate-tourism/a-78362462--18cb3d6fa134.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-the-cool-north-handle-a-surge-in-climate-tourism/a-78362462?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With heat records continually being broken and southern summers getting hotter, travelers are heading north. Fragile ecosystems are paying the price.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Fatty food raises risk of colorectal cancer</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:688519c6925a55649d89dccf9a4c7f4c74ad5636207a89133015956ee0b0e6f3</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-17T06:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fatty-food-raises-risk-of-colorectal-cancer/a-78284704--78a75758e125.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fatty-food-raises-risk-of-colorectal-cancer/a-78284704?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Did you know fatty foods can increase production of an acid in your gut that promotes tumor growth? That's on top of all the other health risks linked to fatty foods, like fries and burgers.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Hunger stones: The history behind 'if you see me, weep'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b5c6fc36402db775377a825eb2a27788801675068cfbc3dfb6ef3baa82319361</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729--34d8ccc8292a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Centuries-old hunger stones are emerging as Europe's rivers recede. Among the most famous is the Decin hunger stone in the Elbe River with its cryptic message.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Can a drug help prevent trauma? Study with mice suggests so</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23612ea3e45ca648e06525b5ead625e261a6237867ca18cad0030b7749b77d10</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T06:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-a-drug-help-prevent-trauma-study-with-mice-suggests-so/a-78301961--0a25b16be584.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-a-drug-help-prevent-trauma-study-with-mice-suggests-so/a-78301961?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Researchers in Munich and Stockholm blocked the lifelong social cost of early adversity in mice with a single compound. The catch: it only worked when given during the trauma, not after.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Can we go green without forever chemicals?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c83de73a86fb2e41db851db17b2aa13cfd6b3f8c047fda129b5d8559124d631e</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-13T07:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-we-go-green-without-forever-chemicals/a-77888704--5cf595a2a5e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-we-go-green-without-forever-chemicals/a-77888704?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As nations globally move to ban forever chemicals, should renewable energy technologies be exempt for the sake of saving the climate?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Eurovision bars countries at war from hosting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae5b0dfcb470fd9d3cf9df89ea590f9477a69a0c89a659463331c1445416b4b4</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-12T18:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eurovision-bars-countries-at-war-from-hosting/a-78341915--0c283d70de4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eurovision-bars-countries-at-war-from-hosting/a-78341915?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Eurovision victory will no longer guarantee hosting rights if war or a wider security crisis affects the winning country. The change could have particular significance for recent high-flyers Ukraine and Israel.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU waste packaging rules: Why small businesses are worried</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da939a0ce72469ecf7db7062733779a3b2a59961d08108d21a75d08307af021a</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-12T09:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-waste-packaging-rules-why-small-businesses-are-worried/a-78326555--4758d7b19395.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-waste-packaging-rules-why-small-businesses-are-worried/a-78326555?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU has introduced new rules targeting packaging waste and "forever chemicals." Although the changes will be phased in slowly, some small sellers have already paused shipments due to the additional red tape.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Solar eclipse: What to look forward to</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c4174990a9a574a9dee46419b31835f220e5db5cf25db98eba7eb3d14f88061e</id><updated>2026-09-10T04:55:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-12T07:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/solar-eclipse-what-to-look-forward-to/a-78330594--591cb72e69ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/solar-eclipse-what-to-look-forward-to/a-78330594?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The last solar eclipse visible from the European mainland was in 1999. Here's what to expect, and how to prepare for this rare occasion.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry></feed>
